{"id":"76b41a152803a0c7","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-ultrafilter-extension.md","title":"Ultrafilter Extension Lemma","display":"thm-ultrafilter-extension — Ultrafilter Extension Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-ultrafilter-extension","aliases":["17-thm-ultrafilter-extension"],"display":"thm-ultrafilter-extension — Ultrafilter Extension Lemma","depends_on":["[[17-df-filter]]","[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","[[17-ax-zfc]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; proper-filter variant","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"Corollary 4.1.4; proof via Proposition 4.1.3","source_pages_print":[214],"source_pages_djvu":[230],"legacy_label":"17-thm-4.1.3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-ultrafilter-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-ultrafilter-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ultrafilter-extension — Ultrafilter Extension Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; proper-filter variant"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Corollary 4.1.4; proof via Proposition 4.1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>214</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-4.1.3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中工作，选择公理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abe3ba268ec527f0\" href=\"?note=abe3ba268ec527f0\" title=\"17-ax-zfc\">17-ax-zfc</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F)\n\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\;\n(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land F\\subseteq U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F)\n\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\;\n(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land F\\subseteq U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实际对应原书推论4.1.4，印刷 p.214（DjVu 230），不是原书命题4.1.3的完整有限交性质版本。本地文件名为既有标识，予以保留。已读命题4.1.3的 Zorn 引理论证及推论4.1.4：所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的真滤子组成非空偏序集；非空链的并仍为含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的真滤子；Zorn 给极大元。若极大真滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 也不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\setminus X\">\\(I\\setminus X\\)</span>，加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 生成的滤子仍为真，因为否则某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in U\">\\(Y\\in U\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\cap X=\\varnothing\">\\(Y\\cap X=\\varnothing\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\setminus X\\in U\">\\(I\\setminus X\\in U\\)</span>。矛盾。因此极大元是超滤子。这里使用 AC 作充分假设，没有把超滤子定理与完整 AC 等同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"abe3ba268ec527f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"abe3ba268ec527f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中工作，选择公理见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$。$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"50a46bce013b2772","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中工作，选择公理见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$。$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在 ZFC 中工作，选择公理见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$。$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F)\n\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\;\n(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\land F\\subseteq U).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"I\\setminus X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\cap X=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"I\\setminus X\\in U","display":false}],"bytes":1675,"backlinks":[{"id":"e64b40822eb5f1aa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"421b1aea26ad8bcb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作。$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为句子集；模型关系见 [[17-df-model]]。令 $I=\\{s\\subseteq T:|s|<\\aleph_0\\}$，并给定结构族 $(\\mathfrak A_s)_{s\\in I}$，其中 $\\mathfrak A_s\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 且 $\\mathfrak A_s\\models s$。超积与超滤子接口见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]、[[17-thm-ultrafilter-extension]]；Łoś 定理见 [[17-thm-los]]。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactn